SUMMARY:NRA Rifle Instructor Training
LOCATION:Camp Currier\, Eudora\, Mississippi
DESCRIPTION:Chickasaw Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/558-104485
 \n\nRange Officer / Shooting Instructor\n\nNRA – RIFLE INSTRUCTOR CLASS
 \nNovember 6-8\, 2026\nScouting America Rifle Shooting Ranges Require the
  Supervision of an NRA Trained Rifle Instructor\nIf you are 21 years old 
 or older and interested in working with our Scouts in the Chickasaw Counc
 il Shooting Sports Programs\, come take this three-day class and become a
  trained Rifle Instructor. If so\, you will most certainly put a smile on
  a Scout’s face and yours too.\nRifle Instructor Training Class\nPrereq
 uisites Included:\nBasic Instructor Training 
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/558-104485
