SUMMARY:Virtual Merit Badge College | Greater Finger Lakes Council – Mor
 ning Session
LOCATION:Virtual Camp (Online Event)\, Rochester\, New York
DESCRIPTION:Greater Finger Lakes Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com
 /397-vmbc\n\nAnimation\, Astronomy\, Citizenship in the World\, Communica
 tion\, Environmental Science\, Fish and Wildlife Management\, Game Design
 \, Geology\, Oceanography\, Reptile and Amphibian Study\, Weather\, Merit
  Badge Counselor\n\nGREATER FINGER LAKES COUNCIL PRESENTS\nVIRTUAL MERIT 
 BADGE COLLEGE\nNew Skills. New Adventures. New Opportunities.\nSATURDAY\,
  NOVEMBER 14\, 2026\nYour Next Merit Badge Is Just a Click Away.\nLooking
  for a merit badge you haven't had the opportunity to explore? Want to tr
 y something new\, build your skills\, or make progress toward your next r
 ank?\nJoin Scouts from across the region for a day of\nlive\, interactive
  virtual merit badge classes\nled by approved merit badge counselors. Exp
 lore exciting subjects
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/397-vmbc
END:VEVENT
