SUMMARY:Online Merit Badge College – Mammal Study - November 15 - 1:00 p
 m - 5:00 pm
LOCATION:ONLINE\, Spartanburg\, South Carolina
DESCRIPTION:Palmetto Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/549-onlinem
 bc\n\nMammal Study\n\nOnline Merit Badge College\nPalmetto Council will b
 e offering several merit badge classes online this year. This is a great 
 opportunity for your scout to earn additional merit badges. The cost for 
 each class is $10/scout and is\nnon-refundable\n. Each class will be held
  on Zoom and a link along with additional details and instructions will b
 e sent to participants prior to the class beginning. All sessions will be
  recorded so that scouts can go back and watch any session they may have 
 missed or wish
